# Base

## Improved Android Chrome Compatibility

### Viewport Optimizations
- Set the correct viewport meta tag for better scaling on mobile devices.
  ```html
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  ```

### Touch-Friendly Interface
- Ensure all buttons and interactive elements are large enough to be easily tapped on touch screens.
- Include adequate spacing between interactive elements to prevent mis-taps.

### Faster Rendering
- Minimize the use of large images and optimize them for mobile.
- Utilize lazy loading for images that are not in the viewport.

### Better Mobile UX
- Implement a mobile-first design approach.
- Ensure content is easily readable with appropriate font sizing and contrast.